makefun-diff 1.0.0 is make.fun's own reference program, released under make.fun's MIT licence (LICENSE). Its line
diff (index.js: tokenize, addToPath, extractCommon and the search loop of editRuns) is derived from jsdiff 9.0.0's
Myers line diff (src/diff/base.js and src/diff/line.js of the diff package); its patch grammar, its prefix and suffix
trim and its tie-break between equally short edit scripts are make.fun's own. The upstream's licence and copyright
